MISSION START

HOME 0 0

BATTERY 100
RESERVE 20
SPEED 10
MAX_ALTITUDE 120

SET CRUISE_ALTITUDE = 50

WAYPOINT A 100 100
WAYPOINT B 200 200
WAYPOINT C 250 300

NO_FLY_ZONE ZONE1
RECTANGLE 400 400 500 500
END_ZONE

TAKEOFF CRUISE_ALTITUDE

IF BATTERY < 20
THEN RETURN_HOME

IF OBSTACLE == TRUE
THEN AVOID

IF ALTITUDE > 120
THEN DESCEND 100

FLY TO A
FLY TO B
FLY TO C

RETURN_HOME

LAND

MISSION END